# SCENARIO: baseline_b4_lurekite   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: auto   BOTCFG: auto
# Phase 3 (lean) baseline B4 - lure + kite. DEBUG MODE (pinned bot $H). The bot is sent to a
# lure-armed hunt (`hunt $HUNT`, min_monsters>0 in hunt_scripts.csv) and watched by an @cast camera
# (the camera is the observer: no same-floor player goto reaches a spawn). Server truth: journal
# `LURE ENGAGE` / `KITE ... legs= elapsed= reason=` + audit probe/state for $H; client truth: the
# camera's see_self HP + see_creature / missiles. Metrics: baseline_metrics.py b4.
@srv audit kinds probe,state,cmd,pathout
@srv audit watch $H
@srv audit on expect="enabled=on"
@cam:$H login
@cam:$H perceive reset=1
@srv cmd "$H" hunt $HUNT
@srv cmd "$H" lure optional=1
@cam:$H hold 120 watch=$H
@srv cmd "$H" status expect="state="
@cam:$H hold 180 watch=$H
@srv cmd "$H" status expect="state="
@cam:$H perceive
@srv expect src=srv msg~="LURE ENGAGE" min=1 within=400 optional=1
@srv audit watch clear
@srv audit off
@cam:$H logout
